  "todo_phase_3_bis_template_enrichment": "Templates are placeholders of the form [AGENT_FUNCTION_V1]. Phase 3-bis will replace each placeholder with its full prompt text (vouvoiement, no emoji, citations obligatoires, budget tokens) per docs/05 §22-25.",
